{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"sections\": [\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S01\",\n      \"read\": \"main\",\n      \"long\": \"怕给对方添负担，只敢露一点喜欢；这点亲近已很甜，还不知下次能否更坦白。\",\n      \"follow\": \"能\",\n      \"why\": \"不能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S02\",\n      \"read\": \"all\",\n      \"long\": \"\",\n      \"follow\": \"能\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S03\",\n      \"read\": \"all\",\n      \"long\": \"\",\n      \"follow\": \"能\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S04\",\n      \"read\": \"all\",\n      \"long\": \"\",\n      \"follow\": \"能\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S05\",\n      \"read\": \"main\",\n      \"long\": \"藏着还能装不在乎；被看穿后心里空落，连相处都没把握，怕对方嫌我黏，亲近也像隔层。\",\n      \"follow\": \"能\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S06\",\n      \"read\": \"main\",\n      \"long\": \"安静下来后，我想到对方根本不知道我刚才有多怕被嫌弃，忽然觉得孤单。\",\n      \"follow\": \"能\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S07\",\n      \"read\": \"all\",\n      \"long\": \"\",\n      \"follow\": \"能\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S08\",\n      \"read\": \"all\",\n      \"long\": \"\",\n      \"follow\": \"能\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S09\",\n      \"read\": \"main\",\n      \"long\": \"没底渐成担心：有天对方不再需要我，甚至不愿与我待着；刚才还敢盼那么远，此刻却安静下来，不敢再想。\",\n      \"follow\": \"能\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S10\",\n      \"read\": \"all\",\n      \"long\": \"\",\n      \"follow\": \"能\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S11\",\n      \"read\": \"all\",\n      \"long\": \"\",\n      \"follow\": \"能\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S12\",\n      \"read\": \"main\",\n      \"long\": \"明知再用心也不能保证以后仍这么好，我还是嫌眼下不够，想多陪一会儿。\",\n      \"follow\": \"能\",\n      \"why\": \"勉强\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S13\",\n      \"read\": \"main\",\n      \"long\": \"起初怕给对方添负担，如今怕不再被需要、失去亲近，便想藏回喜欢；可我已不能装不在乎，刚才对对方好也是真心，收回反更难受。\",\n      \"follow\": \"能\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S14\",\n      \"read\": \"main\",\n      \"long\": \"我仍舍不得，也不知以后怎样；可眼下还能亲近，我不再逼自己要永远的保证。\",\n      \"follow\": \"能\",\n      \"why\": \"能\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"overall\": \"S01、S05时间明显偏紧，S06、S09、S12、S13、S14也来不及完整扫完所有组，基本只能优先看主组。S05、S09、S13的主句尤其容易压过头：信息和转折连续堆叠，即使读完也需要额外时间消化；S06、S12、S14则主要是次组内容太多，容易来不及读。S02、S04相对从容。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "5ee0d2f3-d731-4e18-9c36-466494f2f2f5", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261105T125438756245Z", "elapsed_seconds": 149.438, "completed_utc": "2026-11-05T12:57:08.193074+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "faf283edb4b7baaf94c9ef45918b5318daab55903ec9b4a428048c25549c1056", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa238